OL,3,AXi got Trump's red carpet welcome - but
OL,4,Anot everything he wanted
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trade truce that saw both countries
OL,7,Fpause a tit-for-tat tariff war and
OL,8,Fprevent a further escalation, was
OL,9,Fextended by only a few months - from
OL,10,FNovember to January.
